’s runner render: a full-screen","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"purple canvas, an inset rounded interaction area, and a centered draggable card.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The card maps the ","type":"text"},{"code":"origami.Drag","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" Position output to its SwiftUI offset. A release","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"projects momentum and applies rubber-band bounds. Releasing within 100 points of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"center on both axes pulses Reset, matching the placed graph’s snap-to-origin branch.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"title":"Interaction_DragView"}}}